  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Sup de Pub is a private higher education institution specialising in communication, marketing, and advertising. Founded in 1986, Sup de Pub offers a comprehensive range of programs to students across the globe. Choosing Sup de Pub means you're joining a top-notch school in the world of communication and marketing.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At Sup de Pub, you’ll find a range of clubs, events, and support services to help you personally and professionally. The university organises several events throughout the year, such as conferences and seminars, career fairs, and creative workshops, among others. Plus, the school also offers you tailored support and helps your mental well-being.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Sup de Pub does not provide on-campus housing. However, it offers housing support to assist you in securing suitable accommodation near the campus. The school collaborates with housing providers to offer a variety of options tailored to your needs. These housing options include private apartments, shared flats, and student residences.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
